19. HOW IT REACHES THE API (wire shape)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The daemon stores a tool result as JSON {call_id, content:[{text}], is_error}
and serializes it to the provider as a ToolResultBlock {is_error, content}. The
text content IS the envelope string above. is_error=true only ever accompanies a
type="error" envelope (tool misuse) — a command's non-zero exit is is_error=false
with exit="N" in the envelope. Details/display NEVER leave the daemon (UI only).

